  "environment_bible": "Simple modern Japanese apartment living room: beige walls, light wooden floor, deep navy fabric sofa, small white/wood coffee table, low bookshelf with plain Japanese book spines (text not readable), a window at the left casting flat daylight (holiday afternoon). Recurring props: a generic black smartphone running a work-chat app (green rounded app icon with a white speech bubble; chat UI shows Japanese text), a white coffee mug, a closed paperback book. Secondary environments: a bright café table (holiday outing scene) and a dark bedroom at night with faint blue moonlight and a small wall clock. Infographic scenes are plain navy-background screens without environment.",
  "opening_visual_contract": {
    "thumbnail_scene": "The mascot character sits on the living-room sofa, leaning forward tensely, both hands clutching a smartphone whose screen glows with a blank white notification bubble; worried anxious expression, small sweat drop at the temple, eyebrows raised, shoulders hunched. Coffee mug and closed book on the floor. Solid navy blue background. Text overlay on the left: 私、休んでいい？",
    "first_frame_scene": "Wide establishing shot of the quiet Japanese living room; calm holiday stillness. The mascot sits on the sofa reading a closed paperback book. A black smartphone lies on the coffee table; it suddenly vibrates, and a single white notification bubble glows on its screen (no readable text inside the bubble).",
    "first_15s_visuals": [
      "Wide living-room establishing shot: quiet holiday, navy sofa, window daylight, book in hand, phone on the coffee table.",
      "Close-up of the black smartphone on the wooden table beginning to vibrate: white motion arcs around it, the screen lights up with a single white notification bubble; no readable text in the bubble.",
      "Quick cut to the mascot: slight flinch, eyebrows raised, small sweat drop at the temple, body leaning forward toward the phone.",
      "Close-up of the phone screen showing the work-chat app: header ワークチャット, notification preview text 田中さん: 本日の資料、確認お願いします。"
    ]
  },
