  "character_bible": "Recurring protagonist: a bald round-headed male cartoon figure with a large spherical bald head, pale cream skin, heavy sleepy-sad eyelids with a single crease line above each eye, round black eyes with small white highlights, thin curved black eyebrows, minimal curved-arc nose, small neutral line mouth; chibi proportions (large head, compact slightly chubby torso); wears a muted slate-blue crewneck sweatshirt over a white collared dress shirt, khaki straight-leg trousers, and blue canvas sneakers with white laces. Tension = raised eyebrows, small sweat drop at temple, hunched shoulders. Calm = soft half-closed eyes, relaxed posture. Secondary figure (only inside imagined red-tinted bubbles): a female colleague with a short dark bob, beige blouse, neutral office look, shown glancing at a phone with a mildly annoyed expression.",
  "environment_bible": "Main 'holiday' set: a minimal modern Japanese living room with a simple mustard-grey two-seater sofa, light wood floor, small low table, soft daylight from an off-screen window, one wall clock, subtle bookshelf in the background. Office space is never shown as a real location; the colleague appears only inside imagined thought-bubbles. Abstract psychological space: plain cream or navy backgrounds with floating labeled circles, tables, graphs, divider lines and arrows in the same flat style. Phone screens are simplified flat UI, always with Japanese text only.",
  "opening_visual_contract": {
    "thumbnail_scene": "The recurring character sits on a holiday sofa, leaning forward tensely, both hands clutching a smartphone whose screen glows with a single blank white notification bubble; worried expression with a small sweat drop; coffee mug and a closed book on the floor beside him; solid navy background, clean empty text zone on the left half; no text anywhere in the image.",
    "first_frame_scene": "The same character relaxed on the same sofa with a closed book in hand, coffee mug on the floor, calm daylight, phone resting untouched on the low table — the calm moment just before the notification buzz.",
